  "title": "2D platformer controller with coyote time and jump buffer",
  "purpose": "Move a CharacterBody2D like a platformer hero: jump height and time to apex set gravity, early release cuts the jump, coyote time and a jump buffer forgive late and early presses, and ground and air acceleration differ.",
