  "limits": "Side view with up as -y only; no slopes tuning, wall jumps, ladders or one-way platform drop-through. Gravity comes from the jump settings and ignores the project gravity setting. The apex height matches the design value up to the integration error of the physics step (about 2 percent at 120 Hz in the tests). Verified with Godot 4.7.2 headless; written against the Godot 4.3 API.",
